---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base title="Research">
  <section class="frame tight" style="padding-top: var(--sp-5);">
    <div class="grid-margin">
      <div class="eyebrow">Research</div>
      <div>
        <h1 class="page-title">Two ways to sense the wind</h1>
        <p class="dek" style="margin-top: var(--sp-2); max-width: 520px;">
          My M.S. work measured wind directly, from a hexacopter's own sensor hub.
          My PhD work estimates it indirectly, from how the vehicle's motion responds
          to it &mdash; and asks how vehicle inertia changes that estimate.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="horizon"></div>

  <section class="frame tight">
    <div class="grid-margin">
      <div class="margin-col">M.S. &middot; IITM<br/>2022&ndash;2025</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Direct method: UAVs as an alternative to weather balloons</h2>
        <p class="dek" style="margin-top: var(--sp-2); max-width: 520px;">
          A custom sensor hub on a hexacopter measured wind, temperature, pressure and
          humidity directly during flight &mdash; tested at INS Rajali, aboard the ORV Sagar Nidhi
          in the Bay of Bengal, and off coastal Rameshwaram, up to 2 km altitude.
        </p>
        <a href={`${base}research/ms/`} style="display:inline-block; margin-top: var(--sp-2);">Read more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="rule-sm"></div>

  <section class="frame tight">
    <div class="grid-margin">
      <div class="margin-col">PhD &middot; UCSC<br/>2025&ndash;present</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Indirect method: inertia, drag, and model-based estimation</h2>
        <p class="dek" style="margin-top: var(--sp-2); max-width: 520px;">
          Combining SITL simulation, wind tunnel testing at the UC Davis Atmospheric
          Boundary Layer Wind Tunnel, and real flight validation to characterize how
          a multirotor's mass affects wind-estimation accuracy.
        </p>
        <a href={`${base}research/phd/`} style="display:inline-block; margin-top: var(--sp-2);">Read more &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
